  m_Name: Carta_BairroDe15Minutos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Bairro de 15 Minutos
  _titleEn: 15-Minute Neighborhood
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Escola, posto, mercado, trabalho e lazer a at\xE9 15 minutos de casa,
    a p\xE9 ou de bicicleta: menos deslocamento, menos tr\xE2nsito e menos combust\xEDvel
    gasto."
  _summaryEn: 'School, clinic, market, work and leisure within 15 minutes of home
    on foot or by bike: less commuting, less traffic and less fuel burned.'
  _realWorld: "Carlos Moreno prop\xF4s a cidade de 15 minutos em 2016, e Anne Hidalgo
    fez dela promessa de campanha em Paris, em 2020, com p\xE1tios de escola abertos
    ao p\xFAblico, \xE1rvores e ciclovias."
  _realWorldEn: Carlos Moreno proposed the 15-minute city in 2016, and Anne Hidalgo
    made it a campaign pledge in Paris in 2020, opening school yards to the public
    and adding trees and bike lanes.
  _tradeOffs: "Bairro bom de viver tende a encarecer e expulsar quem paga aluguel,
    e a ideia funciona pior na periferia espalhada, onde faltam com\xE9rcio e servi\xE7os."
  _tradeOffsEn: A pleasant neighborhood tends to get pricier and push out renters,
    and the idea works worse in sprawling outskirts that lack shops and services.
  _sources:
  - Label: 15-minute city (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/15-minute_city
